  "entries": [
    {
      "ordinal": 0,
      "label": "s1_other_area_plaza_01_01",
      "hash64": "6AB0144E789321D1",
      "text": "这里是宝伴广场。\\c\\n以前被叫做宝伴公园，\\n不知道从什么时候名字就变了。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 8,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "s1_other_area_plaza_03_01",
      "hash64": "6774003CCC4EB6F3",
      "text": "里边那个是宝伴像！\\c\\n宝伴是很久很久以前\\n保护了村子的英雄哦！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 9,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "s1_other_area_plaza_03_02",
      "hash64": "6774013CCC4EB8A6",
      "text": "喂！宝伴像怎么坏掉了啊！\\n丹瑜她终于还是闯祸了吗！？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "s1_other_area_plaza_03_03",
      "hash64": "6774023CCC4EBA59",
      "text": "就算宝伴是坏蛋，\\n但总觉得宝伴像还是很吸引我啊。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "s1_other_area_plaza_03_04",
      "hash64": "6774033CCC4EBC0C",
      "text": "宝伴像的事，谢谢你啦！\\n我也稍微捐了点钱。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    }
  ]
}
